<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>A United India, A Clean India</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #ffffff;
      --text: #111111;
      --muted: #666666;
      --accent: #0f766e;
      --light: #f4f4f4;
      --danger: #b91c1c;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    section {
      padding: 80px 10%;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 680px;
    }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      min-height: 90vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .hero .tagline {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* SPLIT */
    .split {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 60px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .split {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--light);
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    /* LISTS */
    ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    li {
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    }

    /* PROCESS */
    ol {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    ol li {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* RULES */
    .rules li {
      color: var(--danger);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* COMING SOON */
    .coming-soon {
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--text);
      color: white;
    }

    .coming-soon h2 {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .coming-soon p {
      color: #cccccc;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 40px 10%;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="tagline">A United India, A Clean India</div>
    <h1>
      One day. One country. 
      <br>₹1 crore to be won.
    </h1>
    <p>
      Teams across India compete to clean real public spaces in a single day.
      Every sack counted. Every claim verified.
      <br>
      <br>
      Prizes:
₹25 lakh, ₹20 lakh, ₹15 lakh —
plus ₹1 lakh each for the next 50 teams.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT + REWARDS -->
  <section class="split">
    <div>
      <h2>What is this?</h2>
     <p style="margin-top:16px;">

I was in Madurai recently and spent time around the temple area. It was filthy. This is a city that sees millions of visitors and has deep cultural and religious importance, yet the public spaces around it are treated like dumping grounds. 

 </p>
      <p style="margin-top:16px;">
A few weeks later I read that Madurai had <s>appeared on</s> topped a list of India’s dirtiest cities.That made the problem feel concrete rather than abstract. We clearly do not have a working way to deal with this at scale, so this is an attempt to try something direct and measurable.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:16px;">
        It is a measurable, documented, competitive event with real consequences.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Rewards</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>1st Place:</strong> ₹25,00,000</li>
        <li><strong>2nd Place:</strong> ₹20,00,000</li>
        <li><strong>3rd Place:</strong> ₹15,00,000</li>
        <li><strong>Next 50 Teams:</strong> ₹1,00,000 each</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:16px;">
        ₹50L is kept aside so teams don’t have to pay for basic safety gear themselves.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  
  <!-- COMING SOON -->
  <section class="coming-soon">
    <h2>Coming Soon*</h2>
    <p>
      *As soon as someone funds ₹1.5 crore for prizes and logistics
      and the Prime Minister declares a national holiday for this.
    </p>
  </section>


